I have never seen this discussed anywhere, so here goes my first post,
a SPOILER!  Yeah, you got it.


WARNING!  **SPOILER**

Orcs often occur in large bunches from 2nd level on down.  If you happen to
see one moseying around, make a beeline for the nearest or most remote door.
As soon as you're in the doorway, drop a single gold piece [d1$], and walk
out the door.  Try to position yourself outside the door in a way that you 
will not be hit from diagonals.  As soon as the orcs walk through the door,
POW! Right in the kisser!  Kill them as they predictably pick up the gold.
When you go back to the pile after killing all of them, there will be much
more that just ONE gold piece.  This trick works with dragons, centaurs, and 
orcs, although I'm sure there are far more monsters that can actually do this.
Naturally, the lower the level, the more you will get for each orc slaughtered.



